[00:10.15] Close your eyes and look at me
[00:17.33] I'll be standing by your side
[00:23.17] In between the deep blue sea
[00:28.97] And the sheltering sky
[00:34.65] If we find no words to say
[00:40.56] To the rhythm of the waves
[00:46.66] Then we'll both surrender there
[00:53.25] Walking on airㅤ
[00:56.96] And the worries of the day lie down
[01:02.72] Under cover of the fading clouds
[01:08.99] The secrets of the night
[01:11.63] Come alive in your eyes
[01:16.65] You don't have to hurry
[01:22.84] You don't have to try
[01:28.38] You don't have a care
[01:34.13] You're walking on air
[01:37.36] 
